            "created_at": "2025-07-31T07:36:54.264732+00:00",
            "notes": "Fade orbs is a really good round 1 item because it gives you a lot of options that provide immediate value \n\n1. leave stationary healing orbs for dps/support, next to doorways etc\n2. double-orb (heal orb - fade heal orb) \n3. Double damage orb into coalescence \n4. Cast orbs when they're on cooldown (get in the habit of predicting which orb will be needed and casting to prime fade)\n\nIt doesn't matter what items you get, the heartbeat sensor is fantastic, so is ability and dps power\n\nMaybe you get voidhoppers if they have a JQ and Ana & you don't have a Kiri, but I think you're just cooked anyway atp",
